	(text "RADIOBOARD2027 - ESP32-C5 Wi-Fi co-processor for ControlBoard2027 (ESP-Hosted over SPI)\nPower: controlboard +3V3 over the J2 cable, or USB-C alone for flashing (TPS2116 mux).\nSignals cross sheets through sheet pins (hierarchical labels); rails (+3V3_HOST, GND) use global labels and power symbols.\nDesign justification: DESIGN_NOTES.md."
